incident_description:
I bought the Electrical Appliance : ABORNI Light Socket Adapter (ASIN: B0B45JV825) from Amazon.com The product exploded and caused a fire during use, injuring a child. I sent the product to the electrical safety department for inspection, which concluded that the product's circuitry was non-compliant and that the product's ground connection was open, posing a risk of short-circuiting and causing a fire as well as a risk of electrical shock from leakage. (ASIN: B0B45JV825) does not comply with the U.S. Electrical Safety Code regulations and poses a potential risk of causing a fire or explosion, as can be seen through the product's reviews on Amazon, the product (ASIN: B0B45JV825) has caused harm to too many people, and products like this shouldn't be sold on Amazon.com, and instead of responding in any way Amazon is continues to sell this product in order to make money. In order to prevent more customers from being harmed, please ask Amazon.com to stop selling this product and recall it immediately! (This product is still available on Amazon.com, Product ISIN: B0B45JV825). This product is available from: B0B45JV825, Their ASIN : B0B45JV825, If you don't want more Americans to be injured or killed as a result, please ban this product from Amazon.com!

(Product link:  https://www.amazon.com/ABORNI-Prong-Light-Socket-Adapter/dp/B0B45JV825?th=1
)
(Product Name: 2 Pcs ABORNI 3 Prong Light Socket to Plug Adapter, E26 Light Socket Outlet, FCC Listed Polarized Light Socket Adapter, Light Bulb to 2/3 Prong Outlet) Socket Splitter Converter for Garage Porch(Black)
)

Dehumidifier purchased on Amazon in November 2020 (Product = 4,500 Sq Ft Energy Star Dehumidifier with Pump; Manufacturer = Ivation; 
ASIN# = B078HVJG8Y; Item model number = IVADH50PWP2). 
In July 2021 the fan within unit exploded projecting black plastic debris out of unit and across the room. The unit had a strong charred electric smell.
